{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "c2696906a16ab5844b27ba5d835ce6589de49ff8d7fc94ebda0ebc39d6b414ae",
  "bundle_request_count": 15,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:0ca6ed820d5821691acf934780d1c0cf4c27c2a33c260df286507816961e8590",
      "request_id": "0ca6ed820d5821691acf934780d1c0cf4c27c2a33c260df286507816961e8590",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bf5179abb4c665b35f47322c6fe6edd7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网首轮出局——他二十年没在大满贯第一轮输过球。世界排名，掉到了第十二。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "1a371e45bb18b43a4ddf3a41bbf8a012d85b2c4fc5dcd8e8707c59c2ef24d67d",
      "words_sha256": "2b60d87d8ab18df61c6bfb135f4f7eb1e0b17d89118f0f1650b8c708339f3548"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:15cf293dba5db4a33f80a421360fddd4ab34d55173128732e06fabbcf48ec9cb",
      "request_id": "15cf293dba5db4a33f80a421360fddd4ab34d55173128732e06fabbcf48ec9cb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "688aa6b7d30f5fb4cfb3f87df1b3ba41",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三天后，上海。他第二轮连丢两盘，输给了胡尔卡奇。这项赛事他拿过四次冠军，之前最差也是四分之一决赛。这一回，他只拿到十分。比分是 6 比 4、6 比 3。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "eb32d9a59d056ece03a90511b003cbbe8aed9441a21e172e0deb3895576c4fa5",
      "words_sha256": "23224da281c99b4c2ede0b73cf30bb0d4dc14e4fcc28e7a235667349e848a0c6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:25db92c79f9aad739c4dfc525f446c4bb7d3505148fde7908dd7b581f92efa14",
      "request_id": "25db92c79f9aad739c4dfc525f446c4bb7d3505148fde7908dd7b581f92efa14",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a91da52fd0d60986e0ce4452e14d1d39",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "其实这一整年，都不像他。一月澳网决赛，他先赢一盘，还是输给了阿尔卡拉斯。墨尔本的决赛，他十一次进来，第一次空手而归。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5827e4dc4bbe1927a34c247ad3133946a7822f22a18b7500ef12fb4cbc35b037",
      "words_sha256": "af78b45acf74e2e6d178d28d5bcf2ae17f87c2a825b67cd83111bb194fbb5c1a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2fba5ae265d364628330e3bea4305cb1454a119e97b38ab63beb8f0ba46c07a8",
      "request_id": "2fba5ae265d364628330e3bea4305cb1454a119e97b38ab63beb8f0ba46c07a8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "70d6838f8116b98f3c1968ba5ca4067f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海输完，他说接下来只打巴黎。十月十六号，他改主意，接下巴塞尔外卡。那是他十五年没去过的球场——二零零九年，他在那儿的决赛赢了费德勒。巴塞尔 500 分，拿下冠军，319 分的坑就填上了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f90483d7c7c0856c729312ca8c2772d6017a2f170d1f9e1792c84ccf96e6771b",
      "words_sha256": "e60ccba02222d254a22a01945ac291a99be3380fd61d63e2be9750006781c63d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4b0bf18e91710add6abf0440da6b602d9fd8526a241aab6b482599142f8c7436",
      "request_id": "4b0bf18e91710add6abf0440da6b602d9fd8526a241aab6b482599142f8c7436",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "58774ded7f3d718de85bcf053026d8a6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "下周巴塞尔，霍达尔也在签表里。追的人和被追的人，同一块场地算账。德米纳尔去维也纳抢分，最后巴黎一千分收官。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8904cfb3c899b01cdd877f6e72b5f93974797950461db857a15cd7fb648a6d21",
      "words_sha256": "ce9025dc636d2d8a49acac5b298a2091ca6f2f53a50077a68de762cecc03142b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:59d89c3eba2ce55d941afd2c4d74e9349e11d7121a2c1ee742f4f905863fe218",
      "request_id": "59d89c3eba2ce55d941afd2c4d74e9349e11d7121a2c1ee742f4f905863fe218",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "06fdb5ed3493c384c0e4c4406c8abc85",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三个星期前，他刚在北京拿到第一百零二个冠军。他在北京三十四战全胜，三十九岁——上一个这么大年纪还能夺冠的人，是一九七七年的罗斯沃尔。决赛首盘抢七 7 比 3，第二盘德米纳尔伤退。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2b2717a873af8e6d2b13489780ed8bb4da1290c5f04356b7f2cc8f26c20827ee",
      "words_sha256": "9c8f71ffdae1cc843f1cf8cb8b9e682edf317e7c3753e2274332de855600dfed"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:75b0e93e36ffe10566e7e301710f44cf327e9470fcb302dac4e25d60328210a3",
      "request_id": "75b0e93e36ffe10566e7e301710f44cf327e9470fcb302dac4e25d60328210a3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "81f238ef71af0a81330b21deee8ea05e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以那句『还要不要打下去』，不是退役预告。十天之后，他给了自己答案。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e5b71adf3cec1cf0e3836df3aa50a346d7f83022423a397ce25a66dcaca322ed",
      "words_sha256": "d422f7a22a6a483ccd2b69bd066d99b19aca9cf9d3ffc41e8d81f74334bdcdcc"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:89f89a80a1abc0026fec0a068b896b5adf5bea172d08cc42c4c37becd35c2291",
      "request_id": "89f89a80a1abc0026fec0a068b896b5adf5bea172d08cc42c4c37becd35c2291",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8e599054f8e81a821515dbc6cfaa4fc1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "年终总决赛，一年只收八个人。辛纳膝伤、赛季报销，这条线掉到了第九名。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3f076b5f0fa53f20123a579dc3d9c36d8e5a7c4f2aab93ac00b9a71f980f8309",
      "words_sha256": "710eef7d80e450ffa5b2f9938c1df78ca09320a467e1598b79474de9a7f989a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9be87765c27983d76782c440188322175f31d6aaa5254132cda9597534a234af",
      "request_id": "9be87765c27983d76782c440188322175f31d6aaa5254132cda9597534a234af",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b6b9a56f3c93b61da9d838f10bb68350",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "只是这个冠军赢得并不痛快：半决赛，梅德韦杰夫被取消资格；决赛，德米纳尔打了一盘就伤退。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "84feb38b9ed94be2a83c3b66a2bd44a31b836ea22627f22786f08d3831bd7273",
      "words_sha256": "019e9469ceb827b38a7e3c099ce6711c8692a12bd8de0c9aba22a912841f664b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a45ba81a9aeaadeda1612d520f5c20f42bce295554043665653a26eca6d38614",
      "request_id": "a45ba81a9aeaadeda1612d520f5c20f42bce295554043665653a26eca6d38614",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "712ead0233a78ecbf2f8e6e4a258c350",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七次年终冠军，历史第一人。现在，他必须先抢一张入场券。门票不认名字，只认积分。巴黎落幕那天——三十九岁的他，还在不在门里？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b104186c08933f5aa48e3b8d0db836cd24db493ca8d31fe5cc3f53f0dfab2b65",
      "words_sha256": "ceacd00b2d0a43f9a06029bf0b0b41f72b82e057e8d652d56350eebaa11cd90d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a6b9df569d36113feb0296c0c8145debc301ccf0d61734b20ac5c329a3d718c6",
      "request_id": "a6b9df569d36113feb0296c0c8145debc301ccf0d61734b20ac5c329a3d718c6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "40058585419a4c20fcd89579fac44bcf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网首轮出局的那个晚上，所有人都在问。所以那句『还要不要打下去』，不是退役预告。十天之后，他给了自己答案。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "bab8f134a9aa5b8d0b587ad5772382bb2e50c944e01985dcb88f763075958145",
      "words_sha256": "2c23e4f1ec024d239167865b5d3f3c9506b55a853c773f368da70542e93cb959"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:a7fb0fec07a3782f55d6c0d5cd7d0fb557016c7ffdf430f177171f906c63f3de",
      "request_id": "a7fb0fec07a3782f55d6c0d5cd7d0fb557016c7ffdf430f177171f906c63f3de",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "99b14c828be5b7a046565c09834c3662",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "现在坐在门里的第九名，是二十岁的霍达尔，三千一百五十九分。门外站着两个人：德米纳尔，差二百七十九分；德约科维奇，差三百一十九分。兹维列夫锁定席位，辛纳赛季报销，入围线降到第九。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "81c7ce37bf9be2b6d27cb5f5ae30e6ee6910587e871528401c2e3acbdb5a103d",
      "words_sha256": "5ba16f771a54af59636de961b1ad43843faa7468d16ab45d69b43069db9ffd23"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:ab63af6c6045938afa46a2432b78de891b2e59b2f45e06b18341664f8af8b6c1",
      "request_id": "ab63af6c6045938afa46a2432b78de891b2e59b2f45e06b18341664f8af8b6c1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e585040d6c7bafcb0f0a90bad8514739",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "世界第十二，去抢最后一张门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7378c3c3c180722423dcd76c581b16d3e791762808e1a025a1ef83be6e1ab175",
      "words_sha256": "45225606dfb1ad414a92d39d0f0f76d12ac392b30401ea39f16c36333bbe70e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e269ca024e371d26d1fb1d332a307089be6d111deda2b1378dcb2e39304a28ac",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fb2b9dc96d0c134c3b21b3c6fcb7c8a4cf87a64dd40007590967d42fd7a88b53",
      "request_id": "fb2b9dc96d0c134c3b21b3c6fcb7c8a4cf87a64dd40007590967d42fd7a88b53",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "79d523e38d0d2d173e1632af8b8fe5f0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一个上海，霍达尔半决赛赢了梅德韦杰夫，一路打进决赛，一趟拿到六百五十分。北京结束时还坐在门里的德约，就这样被挤到了门外。决赛他输给了福基拉，但六百五十分，已经把他送进了都灵的门里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "55dcbf84015e0eb7c7eb5d896488e42107290adac5aad2ae19966523d1686e77",
      "words_sha256": "bec99ea0df8362e4f51500c8753baeac5d171cd29290df4371c108dcd480b7d4"
    },
