        "cache_key": "688aa6b7d30f5fb4cfb3f87df1b3ba41",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三天后，上海。他第二轮连丢两盘，输给了胡尔卡奇。这项赛事他拿过四次冠军，之前最差也是四分之一决赛。这一回，他只拿到十分。比分是 6 比 4、6 比 3。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "55dcbf84015e0eb7c7eb5d896488e42107290adac5aad2ae19966523d1686e77",
      "words_sha256": "bec99ea0df8362e4f51500c8753baeac5d171cd29290df4371c108dcd480b7d4",
      "words_path": "voice_08.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "79d523e38d0d2d173e1632af8b8fe5f0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "同一个上海，霍达尔半决赛赢了梅德韦杰夫，一路打进决赛，一趟拿到六百五十分。北京结束时还坐在门里的德约，就这样被挤到了门外。决赛他输给了福基拉，但六百五十分，已经把他送进了都灵的门里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5827e4dc4bbe1927a34c247ad3133946a7822f22a18b7500ef12fb4cbc35b037",
      "words_sha256": "af78b45acf74e2e6d178d28d5bcf2ae17f87c2a825b67cd83111bb194fbb5c1a",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a91da52fd0d60986e0ce4452e14d1d39",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "其实这一整年，都不像他。一月澳网决赛，他先赢一盘，还是输给了阿尔卡拉斯。墨尔本的决赛，他十一次进来，第一次空手而归。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "1a371e45bb18b43a4ddf3a41bbf8a012d85b2c4fc5dcd8e8707c59c2ef24d67d",
      "words_sha256": "2b60d87d8ab18df61c6bfb135f4f7eb1e0b17d89118f0f1650b8c708339f3548",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bf5179abb4c665b35f47322c6fe6edd7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网首轮出局——他二十年没在大满贯第一轮输过球。世界排名，掉到了第十二。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e5b71adf3cec1cf0e3836df3aa50a346d7f83022423a397ce25a66dcaca322ed",
      "words_sha256": "d422f7a22a6a483ccd2b69bd066d99b19aca9cf9d3ffc41e8d81f74334bdcdcc",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "81f238ef71af0a81330b21deee8ea05e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "所以那句『还要不要打下去』，不是退役预告。十天之后，他给了自己答案。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "f90483d7c7c0856c729312ca8c2772d6017a2f170d1f9e1792c84ccf96e6771b",
      "words_sha256": "e60ccba02222d254a22a01945ac291a99be3380fd61d63e2be9750006781c63d",
      "words_path": "voice_12.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "70d6838f8116b98f3c1968ba5ca4067f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海输完，他说接下来只打巴黎。十月十六号，他改主意，接下巴塞尔外卡。那是他十五年没去过的球场——二零零九年，他在那儿的决赛赢了费德勒。巴塞尔 500 分，拿下冠军，319 分的坑就填上了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "8904cfb3c899b01cdd877f6e72b5f93974797950461db857a15cd7fb648a6d21",
      "words_sha256": "ce9025dc636d2d8a49acac5b298a2091ca6f2f53a50077a68de762cecc03142b",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "58774ded7f3d718de85bcf053026d8a6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "下周巴塞尔，霍达尔也在签表里。追的人和被追的人，同一块场地算账。德米纳尔去维也纳抢分，最后巴黎一千分收官。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b104186c08933f5aa48e3b8d0db836cd24db493ca8d31fe5cc3f53f0dfab2b65",
      "words_sha256": "ceacd00b2d0a43f9a06029bf0b0b41f72b82e057e8d652d56350eebaa11cd90d",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "712ead0233a78ecbf2f8e6e4a258c350",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七次年终冠军，历史第一人。现在，他必须先抢一张入场券。门票不认名字，只认积分。巴黎落幕那天——三十九岁的他，还在不在门里？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "7378c3c3c180722423dcd76c581b16d3e791762808e1a025a1ef83be6e1ab175",
      "words_sha256": "45225606dfb1ad414a92d39d0f0f76d12ac392b30401ea39f16c36333bbe70e0",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e585040d6c7bafcb0f0a90bad8514739",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "世界第十二，去抢最后一张门票。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e269ca024e371d26d1fb1d332a307089be6d111deda2b1378dcb2e39304a28ac",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
